OL,3,GNEWSAVillage Co-op ram raid 'shocking',
OL,4,AMP says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA village shop has been ram raided in
OL,7,Fwhat the local MP called a "reckless
OL,8,Fand unacceptable" act.
OL,10,FSurrey Police said officers were called
OL,11,Fto the Co-op in Rowledge shortly before
OL,12,F03.25 BST on 6 October, following a
OL,13,Freport of an attempted burglary.
OL,15,FTwo vehicles, both believed to be black
OL,16,FSUVs, were reportedly used to ram open
OL,17,Fthe building's doors and windows,
OL,18,Faccording to the force.
OL,20,FAfter failing to gain entry to the
OL,21,Fstore, officers said the vehicles fled
OL,22,Fthe scene.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
